   "title": "N. Korean officials pay tribute to fallen Chinese soldiers at Friendship Tower",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261026/n-korean-officials-pay-tribute-to-fallen-chinese-soldiers-at-friendship-tower",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
