   "title": "UK, Nigeria Collaborate on AI Governance, Digital Transformation",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/26/uk-nigeria-collaborate-on-ai-governance-digital-transformation/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
