   "title": "Elon Musk and Madagascar’s richest man turn to the same sector with $1 billion US media bet and $450 million Nigeria deal",
   "url": "https://africa.businessinsider.com/local/markets/elon-musk-and-madagascars-richest-man-turn-to-the-same-sector-with-dollar1-billion-us/gzh5sjr",
