   "title": "3 Tankers of Russian Diesel Headed for North America, Russian Deputy PM Says",
   "url": "https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/10/24/3-tankers-of-russian-diesel-headed-for-north-america-russian-deputy-pm-says-a94073",
